{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2021-12-08 02:00:00', 'title': 'STANLEY BLACK & DECKER TO SELL SECURITY BUSINESS FOR $3.2 BILLION TO SECURITAS', 'text': 'NEW BRITAIN, CONN., DEC. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 STANLEY BLACK & DECKER\xa0(NYSE: SWK) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT FOR THE SALE OF MOST OF ITS SECURITY ASSETS TO SECURITAS AB (STO: SECU B) FOR $3.2 BILLION IN CASH.'}